{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "10040eb3-7a62-8965-bbd4-81525378da34",
  "created_at": "2026-03-04T14:16:06-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "George Brownell",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:14:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:14:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. I am calling about a pothole. It broke my tire yesterday. The tire blew, and now the rim is bent. Four hundred dollars, maybe more, I don't know yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:14:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. I'm sorry. Where did it happen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:14:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is on Malbone Road, in front of number 398. It is right in the bike lane, you understand? Not even the car lane. I move over for a bicycle, and boom."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:15:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 398 Malbone Road, bike lane. Let me get that into the system. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:15:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "George Brownell. B-R-O-W-N-E-L-L. Wait, one moment. [pause] Sorry, I am holding the phone upside down. Okay. Now you can hear me better, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:15:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Loud and clear now, Mr. Brownell. Best number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:15:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 401-555-0162."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:15:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'm putting in a request for the crew to look at that pothole and get it patched."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:15:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And can I have a reference number? For the request. I need something to show, for the bill from the garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:15:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Hang on a second. [pause] Okay, your reference number is 4471. Write that down, and I'd also keep your repair receipt."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:15:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four, four, seven, one. Yes. I have it. I only want it fixed before someone else has the same problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:15:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. The crew will get to it as soon as they can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:15:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Denise. God bless you, and have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:16:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Brownell. Take care."
    }
  ],
